  - Stage_02
  - Stage_03
  classDescriptions:
  - Conjures up demonic entities to assimulate power. Has faster shoot power then
    angels and can steal and stun enemies when hitting them with your soul. Weak
    to light orbs and gets them.
  - Garners favour from the angels. Has more soul charge then devils and gets increased
    power when falling behind. Recharges soul when hitting light orbs.
